veat indicates that capacity and throughput must be managed to maintain timely responses to data-subject petitions [Data: Entities (555); Relationships (541)].\"} ,{\"summary\":\"Overall governance flow from petition to enforcement\",\"explanation\":\"The interconnectedness of ANPD, PETICOES DE TITULARES, FISCALIZACAO E SANCOES, and MECANISMOS DE REGISTRO DE RECLAMACOES outlines a holistic governance cycle: petitions are filed, evaluated, and responded to by the supervisory authority; enforcement actions are mobilized when processing is inadequate; and complaint registration mechanisms support the end-to-end handling of petitions. This flow is evidenced by the concerted links among the central petition entity and the enforcement and registration mechanisms, indicating a tightly coupled governance loop designed to uphold data-protection standards and accountability [Data: Relationships (537); Relationships (540); Relationships (541); Entities (554); Entities (553); Entities (555)].\"} ] ,\"rating\":7.0,\"rating_explanation\":\"The impact severity rating is moderate-to-high due to an active petition-and-enforcement framework that directly affects data-subject rights and controller compliance, with centralized petition handling and formal enforcement pathways. [Data: Relationships (537); Relationships (540); Relationships (541); Entities (554); Entities (553); Entities (555)].\"}"}, "metrics": {"attempted_request_count": 1, "successful_response_count": 0, "failed_response_count": 0, "responses_with_tokens": 1, "prompt_tokens": 2401, "completion_tokens": 5765, "total_tokens": 8166, "compute_duration_seconds": 28.941612005233765, "streaming_responses": 0, "retries": 0, "requests_with_retries": 0}}}